{"id":"874d5c62b2673eb8","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-maxsathalf.md","title":"Conditional expectation guarantee for Max Sat","display":"thm-maxsathalf — Conditional expectation guarantee for Max Sat","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-maxsathalf","aliases":["27-thm-maxsathalf"],"display":"thm-maxsathalf — Conditional expectation guarantee for Max Sat","depends_on":["[[27-df-maxsat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.11.4 Theorem 2.27","source_printed_pages":"118","source_pdf_pages":"142","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-maxsathalf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-maxsathalf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-maxsathalf — Conditional expectation guarantee for Max Sat"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88afb3e9aa26fa43\" href=\"?note=88afb3e9aa26fa43\" title=\"27-df-maxsat\">27-df-maxsat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.11.4 Theorem 2.27"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"118"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"142"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*\">\\(C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*\\)</span> 及其全部输入条件如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"88afb3e9aa26fa43\" href=\"?note=88afb3e9aa26fa43\" title=\"27-df-maxsat\">27-df-maxsat</a>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge d\\ge1\">\\(|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge d\\ge1\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[m]\">\\(k\\in[m]\\)</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 上均匀分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E[W(X)]=\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k(1-2^{-|A_k|-|B_k|})\\ge(1-2^{-d})\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\ge(1-2^{-d})W^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb E[W(X)]=\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k(1-2^{-|A_k|-|B_k|})\\ge(1-2^{-d})\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\ge(1-2^{-d})W^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;W(a)\\ge(1-2^{-d})W^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;W(a)\\ge(1-2^{-d})W^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个非空一致项在均匀输入下为 1 的概率为 2 的负次数。依次固定变量时，两种固定值对应的条件期望平均等于当前期望，故总能选取不降低它的一侧，得到确定性构造；每次可直接计算有限项和。d=1 给出一半保证，d=2 给出四分之三保证。空项被排除是必要的。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-maxsat","status":"resolved","id":"88afb3e9aa26fa43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-maxsat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-maxsat","status":"resolved","id":"88afb3e9aa26fa43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}$；$C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*$ 及其全部输入条件如 [[27-df-maxsat]]，且 $|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge d\\ge1$ 对所有 $k\\in[m]$ 成立。$X$ 在 $\\{0,1\\}^n$ 上均匀分布。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*","display":false},{"tex":"|A_k|+|B_k|\\ge d\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[m]","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E[W(X)]=\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k(1-2^{-|A_k|-|B_k|})\\ge(1-2^{-d})\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\ge(1-2^{-d})W^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;W(a)\\ge(1-2^{-d})W^*.","display":true}],"bytes":1641,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-maxsathalf|thm-maxsathalf — Conditional expectation guarantee for Max Sat]]"}],"outgoing":["88afb3e9aa26fa43"]}